:TEST-ID tests.sugar.drawer_round_trips_ignored
:TEST-CONTEXT monadc.context.reader.drawers
:TEST-PURPOSE Org-like :Name: drawers are accepted and skipped by the reader.
:TEST-EXPECT parse-json
:TEST-MENU sugar
:TEST-MENU-PATH reader/sugar
:TEST-CLI-TARGET reader sugar
:TEST-TIER regression
:TEST-EXPECT-DESUGAR 42
:TEST-STATUS regression-2026-06-26

:Round trips:
assert-eq (int->digit (digit->int 0x30)) 0x30 "decimal roundtrip 0"
assert-eq (int->hex-digit (hex-digit->int 0x66)) 0x66 "hex roundtrip f"
:Round trips:
42
